ematology.\\nJoin EHA today\\nEHA Mentorship Program\\nBecome a mentor today\\nMentoring is about more than sharing knowledge. It’s about building connections, gaining fresh perspectives, and helping shape the future of hematology.\\nIf you believe in the power of community and want to suppo\"}], \"local_exploration\": {\"visited_doc_ids\": [\"web-049ec083060697f21e9e4005\", \"web-1b2e3ae206bf6a7d30e47fb6\", \"web-1e06c10fa8edbbfd5a34f082\", \"web-2681df3d0c7c018f4be24234\", \"web-cadb8bc3ab6b0c81b9da0eab\", \"web-b027569167b331c43c411500\", \"web-88da2678dd6ddd561360f7f6\"], \"visited_pages\": [{\"doc_id\": \"web-049ec083060697f21e9e4005\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/\", \"title\": \"Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership. - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership. - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-1b2e3ae206bf6a7d30e47fb6\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-innovation/grants\", \"title\": \"Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-1e06c10fa8edbbfd5a34f082\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-innovation/grants/eha-grants-hall-of-fame\", \"title\": \"EHA Grants Hall of Fame - The European Hematology Association (EHA)EHA Grants Hall of Fame - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-2681df3d0c7c018f4be24234\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-innovation/grants/eha-grants-hall-of-fame/2026-winners\", \"title\": \"2026 winners - The European Hematology Association (EHA)2026 winners - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-cadb8bc3ab6b0c81b9da0eab\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-innovation/grants/eha-grants-hall-of-fame/2025-winners\", \"title\": \"2025 winners - The European Hematology Association (EHA)2025 winners - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-b027569167b331c43c411500\", \"url\": \"